---
import { friendSiteInfo } from "@/config";
import "@/styles/code-block.css";
import { Content as SiteInfo } from "./site-info.md";
import { Content as ApplicationTemplate } from "./application-template.md";
---

<section class="friend-application custom-md card-base card-plain px-5 py-7 sm:px-8 sm:py-9" aria-labelledby="friend-application-title">
  <h2 id="friend-application-title">友链申请</h2>

  <h3>我的友链</h3>
  <p>欢迎交换友链，以下是本站信息：</p>
  <SiteInfo />
  <p class="text-sm">RSS 订阅：<a href={friendSiteInfo.rss}>{friendSiteInfo.rss}</a></p>

  <h3>友链要求</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>网站无违法违规内容。</li>
    <li>网站可正常访问，并支持 HTTPS。</li>
    <li>保持更新，有自己的原创内容。</li>
    <li>页面整洁，没有影响浏览体验的广告。</li>
    <li>欢迎先将本站添加至你的友链页面。</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>申请格式</h3>
  <p>请按以下格式填写信息，发送至 <a href={`mailto:${friendSiteInfo.email}`}>{friendSiteInfo.email}</a>，确认后会尽快添加。</p>
  <ApplicationTemplate />
  <p>如果网站地址或头像发生变更，也请通过邮件告知，方便及时更新。</p>
</section>

<script>
  import { initCodeCopyFeedback } from "@/utils/code-copy-feedback-init";
  import { initCodeFullscreen } from "@/utils/code-fullscreen-init";

  initCodeCopyFeedback();
  initCodeFullscreen();
</script>

<style>
  .friend-application {
    min-width: 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  p {
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
